Third-party material used by this project

FER-2013 dataset
  Goodfellow et al., "Challenges in Representation Learning: A report on three
  machine learning contests", ICML 2013 workshop. The training CSV comes from
  the Kaggle mirror deadskull7/fer2013 (listed there as CC0). The dataset is
  not redistributed in this repository.

YuNet face detector (face_detection_yunet_2026may.onnx)
  From the OpenCV Zoo, https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo, MIT License.
  Downloaded at build time; not stored in this repository. The 2023mar file is
  downloaded only for tests, as OpenCV's reference.

Test fixture tests/serving/fixtures/face.jpg
  A crop of a NASA astronaut portrait (public domain) distributed with
  scikit-image.

Browser demo (web/)
  Instrument Sans font, The Instrument Sans Project Authors, SIL Open Font
  License 1.1 (web/fonts/LICENSE-InstrumentSans.txt). Variable WOFF2 file
  (wdth axis, latin subset) copied from the npm package
  "@fontsource-variable/instrument-sans".
  Phosphor Icons, MIT License (web/icons/LICENSE-Phosphor.txt). Four SVG icons
  copied from @phosphor-icons/core.
  onnxruntime-web, Microsoft, MIT License. The WebAssembly runtime is copied
  from the npm package at build time.
  pngjs, MIT License. Test-only dependency that reads the PNG fixtures.
  YuNet face_detection_yunet_2026may.onnx (dynamic input size), OpenCV Zoo,
  MIT License. Downloaded at build time; not stored in this repository.
